  "governance": {
    "clinical_adjacent_definition": "Psychology-related health evidence only: the intervention content or principal mechanism must be explicitly psychological, cognitive, behavioural, motivational, self-regulatory, psychosocial or neuropsychological. A medical condition, health service, rehabilitation setting, adherence outcome, functioning outcome or quality-of-life outcome is not sufficient.",
